    "message": "fix(e2e): resolve native Windows aliases before ownership checks\n\nThe real installed Windows application returned the long spelling of an\n8.3 project path. Resolve physical path identity and prefer ordered exit\nwhen an assertion fails, retaining strict root and pinned-handle checks.\n\nProbe short aliases, exact creation times and foreign siblings before\nexpensive builds. Preserve failed native evidence and the full 542-test\nMac runtime result; report only bounded owned-process metadata on failure.",
